<title>SRI LANKA: National 3-month net down 10.4 pct.</title>
<headline>National 3-month net down 10.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of the National Development Bank Ltd, for the three months ended March 31.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			    1997	    1996</p>
<p>    Turnover	   779.48   vs   670.43</p>
<p>    Net profit	 149.88   vs   167.21</p>
<p>    Tax		   57.75   vs    61.50</p>
<p>NOTE: National Development Bank Ltd is one of two blue chip development finance institutions listed in Colombo.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
